WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:01.930
Die!

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:02.810
Stop!

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.820
Yu-No, what's happened to you?

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.280
I'll kill anyone who defies the Emperor.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.910
What did you--

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.540
Yu-No!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:13.650
"Episode 24: The Truth of Dela Granto"

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.860
We won't tell you wild dogs anything.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:17.950
Maybe I'll just start carving you up
until you change your mind.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:21.840
Ears. Eyelids. Lips.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.950
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:27.090
I didn't expect to see her there.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.040
The girl in the mask was my daughter.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.290
A daughter who tries to kill her father?

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:37.260
She's not... just in a 
rebellious phase, right?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:41.480
I don't know why, but Yu-No forgot about me.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:42.860
But...

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.880
I think Yu-No only
temporarily lost her memories.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.290
If they come back to her...

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.860
Boss...

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:59.780
Do you know how
many of our men she's killed?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.350
I'm sorry.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.620
But leave Yu-No to me.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.670
What is this place?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.170
An underground corridor?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.330
It's kind of creepy.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.050
The event element measurement device...

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:24.400
If you make weird noises 
the enemy will find us.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.590
Sorry. Let's get going.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.480
What is this place?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.730
That's dangerous, boss!

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.800
Another prisoner?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.260
Are you okay?

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.610
It's been a long time, Takuya-<i>kun</i>.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.010
Ryuzoji!

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.670
You know him?

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.180
I'll free him.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:12.880
Don't.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.490
What?

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.160
Why did you let them catch you?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.400
You don't even have a body.
You could just escape.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:25.350
The Divine Emperor outsmarted me.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:31.070
I didn't expect her to work with Mother
and prepare a device to seal me.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:34.520
Let's go.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.780
You're looking for the priestess, right?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:44.730
Your daughter.
Yu-No-<i>kun</i>, that was her name, right?

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.800
Tell me. Where is she?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.660
And what will you do when you find out?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.810
Don't tell me you're going to

00:04:56.810 --> 00:05:00.340
try and save the daughter
who forgot you and tried to kill you.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.780
Who is...

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.570
...this guy?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.640
No good.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:11.200
This isn't easy to open.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.280
There must be something important inside.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.720
Oh? Is that you, Amanda-<i>chan</i>?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.420
Sarah!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.840
What are you doing here?

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.400
It's been so long!

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.080
Tell me. Where is Yu-No?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.880
I'll tell you one thing.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:35.190
To allow the god into her body,

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.400
the priestess must offer up
one of her body's functions.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:46.100
Your mother, Keitia, offered
up her sight and became blind.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.250
My mom was a priestess?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.660
Your wife, Sayless, offered up her words.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.820
Thus, she couldn't speak.

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:03.320
And your daughter, Yu-No,
offered up her heart and lost her memories.

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.510
That's...

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:09.210
There is a way to get her heart back.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:15.980
If you break the barrier
and release me, I'll tell you.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.940
I can't do that!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:21.400
Don't you want to save your daughter?

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.540
Your beloved daughter...

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:26.900
Ryuzoji!

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.240
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.490
Looks like we're having a reunion today.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.420
I finally found you!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.210
Wow, she's hot!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.130
Takuya, you know her too?

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.450
I guess, yeah.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.640
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>, I'm sure this
is a load off your shoulders.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.430
Thanks for your help.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.720
You're so naïve.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.840
You don't know what he really wants.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.010
Ignore him.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.300
Don't you think it's strange?

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:10.310
He raped the priestess,
and now his daughter is the next priestess.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.870
That's not all.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.040
He knows me, a man locked
deep below the imperial city,

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:21.020
and that woman, who came
from a completely different culture.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.710
The skin-tight mini-skirt teacher
look you had going was one thing,

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.170
but this outfit is pretty out there, too.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:31.840
What? This is my job's
official uniform, you know.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.740
Niarb! Ryuzoji!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:48.690
The barrier!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.740
I'll be going!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.250
Wait! Ryuzoji!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.970
He's going to try to go back to
the imperial city and bring more chaos.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.780
But I'll catch him before he can.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.600
You sure about this, Sarah?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.890
You're a maid here in
the imperial city now, right?

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.400
It's fine.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:29.730
If you're here, it means
this castle is done for.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.240
And I've had enough fun with the guards, too.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.140
Nothing!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.530
Bye-bye! See you around!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.210
She's the same as ever.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.090
My head hurts.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.260
I feel like I've got a hangover.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:01.070
The room with the priestess
is heavily guarded, of course.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.200
How do we get through?

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.350
Boss, we'll handle it!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.020
We need to pay you back for our screw-up!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.280
Intruders!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.070
Intruders inside the castle!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:14.780
What?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.280
Our top priority is to
protect the Divine Emperor!

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:18.660
Damn it! Hurry!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.150
Nice job, guys...

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.320
Who are you?

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.590
It's me, Yu-No! Your dad!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:48.480
Stop it! Stop!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.890
Don't show me that cloth!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.860
Sayless...

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.200
Sayless! You're inside her, right?

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.040
You tell her too!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.770
Stop it!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.500
Tell her we're family!

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.050
Stop it!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.760
Yu-No, remember! Come back to me!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:49.880
Yu-No, you're my daughter,
the one I love the most.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.450
My daughter and Sayless's daughter!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:01.910
Daddy...

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.070
Yu-No, do you recognize me?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.280
Daddy?

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.790
That's right! Your daddy!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:29.160
Daddy! I missed you, Daddy!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.240
Me too!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.130
I missed you for so long!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.590
Hey, Amanda!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.580
Asche-<i>san</i>!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.520
What is this room?

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.650
Are they starting a circus?

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.900
Welcome to the hall of memories!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.000
You stay here, Yu-No.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.900
Why?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:19.450
There'll be an uproar
if the priestess disappears.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.470
I see.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:22.550
What will you do?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.710
I still have something I have to do.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.120
I'll come back when it's over.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.090
I've been waiting.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.810
You came, didn't you?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:00.460
Takuya-<i>kun</i>.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.590
Ayumi-<i>san</i>?

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:20.610
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, I'm so sorry about
what happened with Sayless-<i>san</i>.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.180
I took the life of the person you loved...

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.550
Yeah... but that wasn't your fault.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.040
Anything my men did is my responsibility.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.620
You haven't changed.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.120
You think so?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.630
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, here.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.370
The Reflector Device!

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:53.560
I kept it safe, because I knew
you'd come to take it back someday.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.650
Thanks.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.120
But I still can't believe it...

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.310
That you're the Divine Emperor.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.600
It's a long story.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:15.310
That day, I was struck by lightning on
Mt. Sankaku, and arrived in Dela Granto.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:21.270
I was saved by Ryuzoji,
who by that point was no longer even human.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:27.090
I took control of Grand Mother
under his supervision.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.640
Over the long years,

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:34.520
the people of Dela Granto had lost
the ability to control the Unified Computer.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:40.350
I found out all the information
I could from Mother.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:47.310
And I learned that Ryuzoji was planning
to use Mother to rule over this country.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:56.040
Grand Mother's mind became afraid of Ryuzoji,
and she chose me to defeat him.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.710
With her help, I was able to create

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.540
a device that could seal creatures
like Ryuzoji, that had no body,

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.710
and locked him in the basement.

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:10.690
And I became the Divine Emperor myself.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:18.310
Mother's will was worshiped as
the words of a god.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.720
So it didn't take long.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.980
It's been so long since
we've had guests! I'm so happy!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.310
What's a kid doing here?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:32.280
It's dangerous to be here, kiddo,
so let's go somewhere else.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.240
What is she?

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.290
Don't look so angry, Amanda-<i>san</i>!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.000
How do you know my name?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:44.460
And Kartz-<i>san</i>, and Deo-<i>san</i>,
and Asche-<i>san</i>, and Bobby-<i>san</i>!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.450
Everybody, smile!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.630
She knows about us too?

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.310
She doesn't look like an ordinary kid.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:58.140
I'm Ai, the AI! I tell everybody
old stories about Dela Granto!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:02.300
You want to hear my stories, right? Right?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.650
When I became Divine Emperor,

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:07.410
I learned the relationship
between Earth and Dela Granto.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:11.650
It was thousands, tens of thousands, no...

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:18.990
Tens of millions of years ago, there was
a super-advanced civilization on Earth.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.330
The people living now call them...

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.610
The Earth Precursors.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:31.160
But one day, their civilization
became exposed to a great danger.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.090
The scientists...

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:37.740
...predicted that big meteors
would fall and everyone would die!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.720
Those meteors...

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.480
Were called "The Tears of God."

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.100
The race that ruled the Earth
was destroyed by meteors...

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.320
Sounds like the dinosaurs.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:50.190
Their scientific abilities had reached

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.460
the point where even the
will of god could not affect them.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.790
In the face of their destruction...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.780
They developed an incredible technology!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.000
It was...

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.420
Amazing, huh?

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:13.670
They'd move this huge island to a
different dimension where it was safe!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.240
This was the birth of Dela Granto,
the dimensional floating continent.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.080
So the whole neighborhood up
and moved, huh?

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.180
Yup.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.530
And the leader of the move
was the female scientist, Grantia.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.850
Scientist? Not politician?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:31.790
Yes.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:37.220
Massive amounts of technology were used
to allow humans to live in another dimension.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.330
For example, artificial plants...

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:42.450
...to provide an oxygen supply,

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:46.290
or the artificial sun Melgio,
a heavy fusion reactor.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.310
You know all them well, right?

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:52.360
But the environment in this other
dimension was too different from Earth.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.340
And everybody started to die!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.550
Humans dropped to
10% of their former population.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.850
Poor things!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.680
The group of scientists
modified living beings themselves,

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.800
to give them the power
to adapt to the environment.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.850
They altered living beings?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.940
Correct. Didn't you find it strange

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:14.420
when you looked at the
living creatures in this world?

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.750
Is that... why Yu-No grew up so fast?

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.680
That was another result of
her adaptation to the environment.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.130
They increased the amount of time
she spent as an an adult,

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.250
to give her more time to be productive.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.310
I see...

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.610
But... this is terrible to say, but...

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.510
A lot of the modification attempts failed.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:47.230
Then these monsters...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.980
They were humans, like us?

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:54.980
But at the same time, they became
unable to survive on the floating continent

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.160
without a certain energy ore.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.410
The name of that ore was...

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.350
Psychite.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.650
What I was researching at Geotech.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.640
The stone that Kanna-<i>chan</i> needed.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.270
The one I came to Dela Granto to find.

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:13.710
And then just when they solved
that problem, they had another!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:17.510
Their calculations for
Dela Granto's orbit were off!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:25.070
According to the orbital calculations I did,
our dimensional floating continent

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:29.400
and Earth continually approach
and separate from each other.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:33.270
This occurs over a 400 year cycle...

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:37.580
Then my dad's 400 Year Cycle Theory...

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.380
It was correct.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.490
Only the leader of the scientists, Grantia,

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.160
could control the huge floating continent.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.270
But...

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:53.270
I cannot escape from
the end of my natural lifespan.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:58.380
Thus, I have developed technology
that will allow my mind to live on as data

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.720
and control the continent
even after my death.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.760
But it has a flaw.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.850
It needs a catalyst upon which I can
project my mind and synchronize to...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.130
A human female was needed.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:14.910
The priestess?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:15.700
Yes.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:19.070
Grantia's scan program would choose her.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:23.490
She would lose one of her bodily functions
to make it easier to synchronize.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:29.470
And that was my mom,
and Sayless, and Yu-No?

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:33.130
Takuya...

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:38.140
The Earth and Dela Granto are about to be
at their point of maximum approach.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.820
If Earth and Dela Granto get too close...

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:47.510
Ka-boom! Big trouble!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.520
Are we going to die?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.750
You just need to do the ritual!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:58.140
The priestess needs to synchronize
with Grantia and avoid the collision!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.790
If that happens...

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.260
Both worlds will be saved.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.110
But a price must be paid.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:11.390
Takuya-<i>kun</i>... This is very hard to say...

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.560
But even if the ritual succeeds,

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:18.320
the priestess, Yu-No,
will most likely be annihilated.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:23.570
That's all I have to say!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.930
Was it interesting, guys?

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.530
